Hi Sam,

If you are willing to work the whole shift that day, it would be much appre=
ciated.  Looking at next month's schedule I am going to end up swapping you=
r days off to Friday and Saturday, so after you work the 10-6pm shift on Fr=
iday the 28th you would then have another day off on Saturday the 1st as it=
 leads into the new month's days off schedule.

[cid:image001.jpg@01DB86B1.740639A0]Logan Bliss | Volunteer Services Lead/R=
anger 1
